rsion of the same statement or number by its speaker, an official or the original source (D168\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:239:## 8. Closing and pull mode (PRD 07, PRD 08)\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:251:## 9. Review pool (PRD 09)\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:257:## 10. Current phase: filing that links facts the way an analyst does (PRD 10)\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:294:## 12. Idea API and service (docs/poc/idea-card.md, docs/poc/service.md)\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:312:## 13. Data (README, \"Local requirements and data\")\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:320:## 14. Operations (README, AGENTS §9)\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:332:## 15. Working rules (AGENTS.md)\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:340:## Index\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:384:| D39 | 2026-10-20 | Writing into the views database: match by where a candidate belongs, then one round of re-judging | in force (amended by D42, D44, D45, D46, D51, D63, D155, D169, D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:387:| D42 | 2026-10-20 | Extraction hands over evidence and candidate views as two things; evidence is matched to what its view alre… | in force (amended by D45, D58, D59, D198, D202, D204, D207, D264, D360, D364) | §6 Extraction |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:391:| D46 | 2026-10-20 | Alex decides Claude's views proposals one by one | in force (amended by D51, D54, D58, D63, D155, D169, D185, D191, D197, D198, D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:511:| D167 | 2026-10-25 | No hard-coded identity for aggregates; the judge gets the evidence, the vocabulary gets the missing measure… | in force (amended by D168, D197, D202) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:512:| D168 | 2026-10-25 | Four corrections found by the D167 measurement: one repeat rule, one replace definition, one succession rul… | in force (amended by D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:545:| D201 | 2026-10-27 | Steps 3 and 4: Jev gives opinions only, the library keeps sources and research arguments, a new question ne… | in force (amended by D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:546:| D202 | 2026-10-27 | The writer retires nothing on a matching label: a replacement is recorded as a revision and both pieces sta… | in force (amended by D203) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:548:| D204 | 2026-10-28 | A repeat is stored as its own source record; the merge becomes a labelled relation | in force (amended by D248) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:725:| D381 | 2026-11-08 | Clean Step 2: a repeat joins only the group it is most like; three acceptance lines; repeats keep their own text | in force | clean-arch PRD §§5–6 |\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1:# Hivemind architecture: the hedge fund research brain\nclean-arch/PRD.md:5:## 1. What the system does\nclean-arch/PRD.md:15:## 2. Architecture at a glance\nclean-arch/PRD.md:54:## 3. The information the system works with\nclean-arch/PRD.md:68:## 4. Step 1: extract theses and evidence\nclean-arch/PRD.md:129:## 5. Step 2: find and compare related evidence\nclean-arch/PRD.md:178:## 6. Step 3: save evidence and links\nclean-arch/PRD.md:191:## 7. Step 4: judge the thesis\nclean-arch/PRD.md:201:## 8. Evaluate Step 1\nclean-arch/PRD.md:499:## 9. Walk one item through the system\nclean-arch/PRD.md:512:## 10. Open design questions\nclean-arch/PRD.md:523:## 11. Design boundary\nclean-arch/PRD.md:527:## 12. Step 1 prompt: c8, adopted (D387)\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1171:## 13. Step 2 prompt: Jev working draft\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1227:## 14. Existing components to reference during the rebuild\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1293:## 15. Architecture challenge: questions before building\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1305:## 16. Future design: entity relationships and cross-entity linkage\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1339:## 17. Implementation plan for review\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1424:## 18. Luna draft and existing production compatibility review\nclean-arch/PRD.md:1484:## 19. Claude review: verified findings and open choices\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
