eeps sources and research arguments, a new question ne… | in force (amended by D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\n546:| D202 | 2026-10-27 | The writer retires nothing on a matching label: a replacement is recorded as a revision and both pieces sta… | in force (amended by D203) | §7 Thesis library |\n548:| D204 | 2026-10-28 | A repeat is stored as its own source record; the merge becomes a labelled relation | in force (amended by D248) | §7 Thesis library |\n725:| D381 | 2026-11-08 | Clean Step 2: a repeat joins only the group it is most like; three acceptance lines; repeats keep their own text | in force | clean-arch PRD §§5–6 |","numLines":12,"totalLines":12},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HEGsUV8Y3NcoKSnR51PazU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
